<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID TO BUY PLN 101 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID TO BUY PLN 101 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid to buy 101 million zlotys worth of the National Bank of Poland's 182-day NBP-bills against a 100 million zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
